## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database Schema & Persistence

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/Ashwin/Desktop/LMS/server/prisma/schema.prisma)
* Add `moderatorPermissions` (`String?` — JSON string) on model `User` storing the module permissions object.
* Add `requestedRole` (`String?`) on model `User` to track what role the user asked for during registration.

```prisma
model User {
  ...
  role                      String    @default("USER") // ADMIN | MODERATOR | COURSE_CREATOR | USER
  status                    String    @default("ACTIVE") // ACTIVE | LOCKED | SUSPENDED | PENDING_APPROVAL
  requestedRole             String?   // Tracks requested tier during registration
  moderatorPermissions     String?   // JSON object storing granular module permissions
  ...
}
```

